WEBVTT

00:02.750 --> 00:04.170
Gods above...

00:05.540 --> 00:11.630
Why do you choose
to put me through such trials?

00:12.170 --> 00:15.250
'Kay, we all good starting off
with juicy love stories, then?

00:15.250 --> 00:18.130
Quit making it sound like
you're ordering the usual round at a bar.

00:18.130 --> 00:19.170
Oh, oh, me first!

00:19.170 --> 00:20.210
Yuka it is, then.

00:20.380 --> 00:22.380
Do you have a crush, Yamada?

00:25.880 --> 00:27.790
Ignorance is strength, I guess.

00:27.790 --> 00:28.540
Seems like.

00:28.540 --> 00:30.500
Huh? Wait, what's that mean?

00:38.630 --> 00:41.790
Okay, how about this?
What sort of guys do you like?

00:41.790 --> 00:42.580
Huh?

00:44.290 --> 00:48.330
Gods above... Oh, gods above...

02:18.630 --> 02:21.290
Well? Well? What sorta guy?

02:21.290 --> 02:24.330
Uh, I guess... The interesting sort?

02:24.330 --> 02:26.830
Saw that coming.
She's always saying that.

02:26.830 --> 02:28.290
And, I guess...

02:28.540 --> 02:30.670
a guy who's cat-like?

02:30.670 --> 02:31.790
You've lost me.

02:31.790 --> 02:32.960
And? What else?

02:32.960 --> 02:36.630
E-enough about me,
what about all of you?

02:36.630 --> 02:41.080
Like, have any of you been asked out?

02:41.250 --> 02:42.170
I have.

02:42.170 --> 02:43.040
Same.

02:43.040 --> 02:44.460
Well, me too, then.

02:44.460 --> 02:45.330
I haven't.

02:45.330 --> 02:47.960
One of these girls is lying.

02:47.960 --> 02:49.080
Two, I'd say.

02:49.080 --> 02:50.540
Quit the psych test!

02:50.540 --> 02:54.670
But getting asked out
is pretty childish, anyway.

02:54.670 --> 02:56.790
What? Wait, why? What do you mean?

02:56.790 --> 03:01.290
Real adults let things slowly brew
until they find themselves

03:01.290 --> 03:03.540
in that sorta relationship.

03:04.000 --> 03:05.040
Or something like that.

03:05.040 --> 03:06.250
They let it "brew"?

03:06.250 --> 03:07.380
Sounds like a pain.

03:07.380 --> 03:09.630
W-well I...

03:10.040 --> 03:11.920
I'd prefer to get asked out!

03:13.500 --> 03:14.460
What's the matter?

03:14.460 --> 03:15.710
No, nothing.

03:15.710 --> 03:18.750
I just don't really get
how to let things "brew."

03:18.750 --> 03:20.630
Oh, well you see...

03:23.170 --> 03:25.130
B-before they even start dating?

03:25.130 --> 03:26.210
Yup.

03:26.630 --> 03:28.210
She means s*x!

03:28.420 --> 03:31.460
Adults treat it like
it's some kind of recreational sport.

03:31.460 --> 03:34.170
They use it as a way
to decide if they wanna really go out!

03:34.170 --> 03:36.670
I'm turning the lights off
before we get in trouble.

03:36.670 --> 03:37.580
Yeah, yeah.

03:37.580 --> 03:39.750
This is bad. I gotta break outta here...

03:39.750 --> 03:42.710
Maybe I can wait
until they all fall asleep.

03:42.960 --> 03:45.130
But if they notice
I'm not in my room upstairs,

03:45.130 --> 03:46.710
all hell will break loose.

03:47.880 --> 03:48.790
Huh?

03:49.500 --> 03:51.960
S-s*x!

03:52.330 --> 03:53.460
What should we do?

03:54.580 --> 03:56.290
Th-this is bad!

03:56.290 --> 03:58.630
D-don't think those thoughts!

03:58.880 --> 04:00.000
C'mon...

04:00.000 --> 04:02.710
Two, three, five... ten?

04:03.710 --> 04:06.380
Wait, what are prime numbers, again?

04:06.380 --> 04:07.290
Hey.

04:08.380 --> 04:12.580
Do you think I'm grown up?

04:12.580 --> 04:14.960
Bwah? Huh?

04:14.960 --> 04:18.710
Wait... now? Here?!

04:25.960 --> 04:27.170
<b>I want to talk tomorrow</b>

04:28.540 --> 04:30.960
I want to talk to you about something...

04:33.960 --> 04:36.790
Hm? What's wrong, Yamada?

04:37.170 --> 04:38.040
Huh?

04:38.750 --> 04:40.210
No, nothing.

04:40.710 --> 04:43.040
Hmm? Wait...

04:43.460 --> 04:45.540
Your blankets are huge.

04:45.790 --> 04:48.330
I-I'm done for!

04:49.290 --> 04:50.250
Huh?!

04:52.960 --> 04:54.170
What?!

04:55.040 --> 04:57.170
H-help me...

04:57.170 --> 04:59.540
What the heck?!

04:59.540 --> 05:01.500
Ms. Moriya! Ms. Moriya!

05:02.040 --> 05:02.830
Now's your chance!

05:02.830 --> 05:03.460
R-right!

05:11.080 --> 05:12.080
Huh?

05:13.830 --> 05:15.500
You wanted to talk?

05:16.380 --> 05:19.210
I-it can wait...

05:19.920 --> 05:22.420
till tomorrow...

05:26.250 --> 05:27.380
Okay...

05:36.040 --> 05:41.830
And so we made it to our group free-time
on the second day.

05:43.880 --> 05:45.210
Now that's a vibe!

05:45.380 --> 05:46.460
Foxy-fox!

05:47.250 --> 05:48.630
Foxy-foxy-foxy-fox!

05:48.630 --> 05:50.920
Quit ruining the mood!

05:48.630 --> 05:50.920
Foxy-foxy-foxy-fox!

05:50.920 --> 05:53.290
These are holy grounds, y'know!

05:53.670 --> 05:56.170
They say if a couple
passes through here holding hands,

05:56.170 --> 05:59.210
they'll be bound together for eternity!

05:59.210 --> 06:00.830
What? Really?

06:00.830 --> 06:03.290
That sure caught your interest.

06:03.290 --> 06:04.460
Fox!

06:04.460 --> 06:06.210
Not getting any search results
saying that.

06:06.210 --> 06:08.880
Gah! Who asked you to look it up?

06:08.880 --> 06:10.170
Fox!

06:10.920 --> 06:11.710
I'm telling you though, there really is-

06:11.710 --> 06:13.080
I told her we'd talk, but...

06:11.710 --> 06:13.080
I'm telling you though, there really is-

06:13.080 --> 06:14.420
I told her we'd talk, but...

06:14.880 --> 06:17.500
How do I bring the audition up?

06:18.330 --> 06:21.420
What do I even want to talk about?

06:21.420 --> 06:23.630
How I don't want her worrying about me?

06:23.630 --> 06:26.210
How I want her to focus on work?

06:26.210 --> 06:27.460
I don't know...

06:27.880 --> 06:28.920
Just...

06:29.170 --> 06:34.250
If she's only here for my sake...

06:35.960 --> 06:37.710
I can't take it.

06:38.630 --> 06:39.460
Fox!

06:53.080 --> 06:54.630
C'mon, let's go.

07:02.540 --> 07:04.750
We haven't had much alone time.

07:05.380 --> 07:06.750
Yeah...

07:06.750 --> 07:08.960
So? You having fun?

07:09.500 --> 07:12.460
I mean... More than I expected to.

07:12.460 --> 07:14.130
Oh?

07:16.080 --> 07:17.170
That's good, then.

07:18.420 --> 07:19.500
That's...

07:22.040 --> 07:23.580
I'm happy to hear it.

07:26.170 --> 07:27.710
What's that mean?

07:27.710 --> 07:28.710
What?

07:29.290 --> 07:30.500
Just what I said.

07:30.500 --> 07:32.920
Happy and fun.

07:33.960 --> 07:35.040
Okay...

07:36.880 --> 07:39.000
Then what's that face for?

07:42.630 --> 07:44.880
N-no reason...

07:45.960 --> 07:49.040
You had an audition booked, didn't you?

07:52.210 --> 07:53.290
Yeah.

07:54.580 --> 07:55.880
I'm sorry...

07:55.880 --> 07:57.670
What are you apologizing to me for?

08:03.580 --> 08:06.250
I just can't do it!

08:07.170 --> 08:08.960
I just...

08:08.960 --> 08:15.080
I really wanted to enjoy our school trip!

08:15.750 --> 08:20.580
I thought if you were having fun,
then I would too!

08:22.420 --> 08:27.040
But all I can think about is the audition.

08:28.000 --> 08:30.420
Can you believe how self-centered I am?

08:32.170 --> 08:35.420
You know, I'm kind of relieved...

08:36.290 --> 08:41.170
Sorry, you probably don't know
how to react to all this.

08:42.250 --> 08:45.750
Turning her back to her job
brings her to tears.

08:47.250 --> 08:49.710
She can't just switch off work mode.

08:51.420 --> 08:53.960
That's the way she is, and why I...

08:54.790 --> 08:55.880
Why I...

08:56.920 --> 08:58.670
Agh, hold it in...

09:01.130 --> 09:02.330
Anna Yamada!

09:07.920 --> 09:09.790
I'm stronger than you think!

09:13.000 --> 09:15.540
I was alone...

09:16.750 --> 09:18.580
But I was fine with it.

09:18.880 --> 09:20.540
<b>List of Passing Examinees</b>

09:18.880 --> 09:23.920
To me the world seemed
like nothing more than a filthy mess.

09:25.290 --> 09:30.130
I was a hollow shell, pathetic and weak.

09:28.210 --> 09:30.080
<b>MURDER
ENCYLOPEDIA</b>

09:30.130 --> 09:36.750
I thought everyone was laughing at me
and making fun of me deep down.

09:37.580 --> 09:40.880
I didn't think a single person
wanted to talk to me.

09:41.420 --> 09:44.040
I thought that was just the way
things were.

09:45.580 --> 09:46.670
But...

09:50.250 --> 09:52.290
I made friends.

09:52.960 --> 09:55.750
Friends like Adachi, Ota, and Kanzaki.

09:55.750 --> 09:59.000
I sometimes talk with Kugenuma
and the guys, now.

09:59.420 --> 10:03.000
I can even talk
somewhat normally with girls.

10:03.290 --> 10:07.290
Our teachers still irk me sometimes,
but I don't hate them.

10:07.790 --> 10:10.080
Where I saw nothing before at school,

10:10.080 --> 10:13.500
bit by bit, I've started noticing things.

10:14.420 --> 10:19.630
Happy things, sad things,
embarrassing things, surprising things.

10:19.960 --> 10:24.000
The once empty world
started to fill with color.

10:25.830 --> 10:28.500
I'll admit it, I like school!

10:28.750 --> 10:31.000
I still would even without you around!

10:31.750 --> 10:33.210
Wha-? How could you?

10:33.210 --> 10:36.380
But it's only because you were.

10:36.380 --> 10:37.580
Huh?

10:42.330 --> 10:44.790
You showed me this world.

10:45.420 --> 10:49.830
You helped me see how beautiful it is.

10:50.210 --> 10:51.750
Because you're in it.

10:54.750 --> 10:56.500
I like you, Yamada!

11:02.420 --> 11:04.210
I...

11:04.460 --> 11:05.750
It's true.

11:05.750 --> 11:11.380
I had lost sight of even the regular,
ordinary every day...

11:13.710 --> 11:14.790
Found 'em!

11:14.790 --> 11:15.960
Prepare the celebration!

11:15.960 --> 11:16.960
Wait, Kan-

11:15.960 --> 11:16.960
Prepare the celebration!

11:16.960 --> 11:17.540
Wait, Kan-

11:20.880 --> 11:23.330
What?! Were they just holding hands?!

11:23.330 --> 11:24.830
Y-you think so?

11:27.130 --> 11:32.710
Ever since I met Yamada,
even the mundane feels special.

11:36.130 --> 11:37.830
And maybe this is going too far...

11:38.420 --> 11:39.500
but it feels like...

11:41.250 --> 11:43.580
Yamada has made me who I am now.

11:47.790 --> 11:49.000
I just...

11:52.330 --> 11:53.830
I want to be...

11:54.750 --> 11:55.830
the smallest...

11:56.960 --> 11:58.830
tiniest part of her life.

12:02.040 --> 12:04.830
Go for it. Your audition.

12:07.500 --> 12:10.250
It's tomorrow, right?
You can still make it.

12:10.250 --> 12:12.000
Yeah, but-

12:12.000 --> 12:15.960
Hop on the next bullet train.
I'll tell the teachers.

12:17.540 --> 12:18.380
Here.

12:22.880 --> 12:24.790
That should be enough to get you there.

12:26.000 --> 12:29.290
This is why your bag was so full?

12:31.540 --> 12:32.630
See ya.

12:33.830 --> 12:35.130
About what you said!

12:37.000 --> 12:39.290
I-I'm just glad...

12:39.960 --> 12:42.790
to see you're still you.

12:46.000 --> 12:47.250
I...

12:48.500 --> 12:50.580
I want to say it out loud, too.

12:58.250 --> 12:59.290
Okay...

13:00.330 --> 13:01.080
So-

13:01.080 --> 13:02.500
Yamada!

13:02.830 --> 13:03.830
Chii?

13:04.170 --> 13:06.670
Everyone's all worked up
saying you're missing.

13:09.670 --> 13:12.380
Decided you want to go
to the audition, didn't you?

13:12.880 --> 13:14.080
<b>Kimi Iro Octave</b>

13:12.960 --> 13:14.130
Here.

13:14.130 --> 13:16.330
You're gonna want to practice, right?

13:17.880 --> 13:18.830
Yeah...

13:18.830 --> 13:21.040
I'll put it in here, for you.

13:21.040 --> 13:23.210
I'll even pack these snacks in for you.

13:23.210 --> 13:24.790
Yikes, talk about packed.

13:24.960 --> 13:27.250
I'll handle things here.

13:27.250 --> 13:28.130
Okay...

13:28.500 --> 13:30.170
Save the tears for later.

13:30.170 --> 13:31.380
Get going!

13:31.380 --> 13:33.830
I will. Thank you.

13:36.170 --> 13:37.170
Yamada.

13:41.880 --> 13:43.330
It'll be all right.

13:46.790 --> 13:47.750
Yeah!

13:55.210 --> 13:59.000
Shoot, that was not the sort of thing
I should say in front of Kobayashi...

13:59.000 --> 14:04.040
Ugh, can hardly call myself leader
after ditching my group like this, huh?

14:04.040 --> 14:05.330
I wouldn't say that.

14:09.080 --> 14:11.380
Yikes, I really gotta get back.

14:18.380 --> 14:21.330
<b>Daichi Cram School
Get into elite schools</b>

14:24.670 --> 14:27.420
I really gotta think of an excuse.

14:27.420 --> 14:30.960
Maybe I'll say I walked Yamada to the
station because she had an emergency.

14:30.960 --> 14:33.710
No, but that's basically
putting the blame on her.

14:33.710 --> 14:43.920
<b>Give us a kiss!</b>

14:33.710 --> 14:34.960
Big congratulations!

14:34.960 --> 14:36.000
Congrats!

14:36.000 --> 14:38.080
No, no, this isn't right!

14:38.080 --> 14:40.170
What isn't? They're a couple.

14:40.670 --> 14:42.790
But they aren't even in the same class!

14:44.210 --> 14:45.710
No! No!

14:44.210 --> 14:45.710
Can you please stop this?

14:45.710 --> 14:46.420
I'm telling you, it's wrong!

14:45.710 --> 14:46.420
Can you please stop this?

14:46.420 --> 14:47.000
I'm telling you, it's wrong!

14:47.000 --> 14:48.670
Honestly, please?

14:50.210 --> 14:51.290
Yeah...

14:51.630 --> 14:52.880
Sorry...

14:53.580 --> 14:57.040
Hara's as strong as they come.

15:01.830 --> 15:03.420
<b>I hope I pass
the entrance exams</b>

15:01.840 --> 15:03.420
<b>Kyotaro Ichikawa</b>

15:01.840 --> 15:03.080
There.

15:06.290 --> 15:07.790
Hmm...

15:07.790 --> 15:09.130
Maybe something like this?

15:09.880 --> 15:10.630
Oh...

15:11.250 --> 15:12.380
Hello?

15:12.380 --> 15:14.540
Make sure you get me something good, okay?

15:14.540 --> 15:17.380
I don't want some dumb keychain
of a robo-Kiyomizu-dera

15:17.380 --> 15:19.130
with someone hopping off, you hear me?

15:19.130 --> 15:22.250
Make it something good like that
Gionido oil blotting paper, 'kay?

15:22.250 --> 15:25.920
And those jari-manju snacks
and the Ranran scented sachets!

15:25.920 --> 15:28.170
And maybe a bottle gourd?

15:28.170 --> 15:30.920
Okay, let's see here...

15:31.080 --> 15:32.080
Wuzzat?

15:32.080 --> 15:35.250
A present. For my sister.

15:35.250 --> 15:36.540
Oh, your sister!

15:36.540 --> 15:38.210
Why's that got you more interested?

15:45.670 --> 15:47.040
Chill out, you two!

15:47.040 --> 15:49.000
Hey! Quit playing with the merchandise!

15:49.000 --> 15:51.170
And you girls cut it out!

15:51.170 --> 15:55.630
<b>Kyoto Souvenirs</b>

15:52.420 --> 15:55.670
Yamada called her parents right away,

15:55.960 --> 15:58.670
who then called the teachers.

15:59.630 --> 16:00.380
And so she made it safely to her audition.

16:00.380 --> 16:01.290
Anna!

16:00.380 --> 16:01.290
And so she made it safely to her audition.

16:01.290 --> 16:02.460
And so she made it safely to her audition.

16:02.460 --> 16:03.960
Papa! Mama!

16:02.460 --> 16:03.960
And so she made it safely to her audition.

16:05.880 --> 16:08.130
It's fun enough
even without Yamada around.

16:09.830 --> 16:10.880
But...

16:11.830 --> 16:14.330
<b>Anna Yamada
I'm headed out</b>

16:11.840 --> 16:14.330
<b>K
Meet you at
the usual spot</b>

16:15.250 --> 16:16.630
Still...

16:17.380 --> 16:21.420
Listen up, our trip is not over
until you're all back home.

16:22.330 --> 16:23.420
Even still...

16:25.790 --> 16:27.500
I just want to be with her!

16:47.710 --> 16:48.920
But...

16:49.540 --> 16:50.960
Where's our "usual" spot?

16:54.130 --> 16:55.540
Where does she mean?

17:02.920 --> 17:04.330
Where?

17:10.460 --> 17:11.630
She couldn't mean...

17:12.880 --> 17:15.420
Library

17:29.170 --> 17:31.380
You're brave coming in here
out of uniform.

17:31.380 --> 17:32.960
Did you get it right away?

17:32.960 --> 17:34.630
Not exactly.

17:34.630 --> 17:36.080
Lots of places to choose from...

17:36.580 --> 17:37.670
But...

17:37.670 --> 17:39.290
<b>Meet you at the usual spot</b>

17:38.000 --> 17:40.630
With all your illicit snacking here,

17:39.750 --> 17:41.330
<b>Jagareko Veggie</b>

17:39.750 --> 17:41.330
<b>Potato Chips
Consomme Home Run</b>

17:41.630 --> 17:43.000
I figured the library.

17:43.750 --> 17:46.130
You're on the books for it, and all.

17:46.130 --> 17:47.040
Hmm?

17:47.380 --> 17:48.880
That pun was unintentional, okay?

17:52.710 --> 17:54.330
So your audition...

17:58.380 --> 17:59.330
What?

18:00.210 --> 18:02.460
I still don't know. I did my best, but...

18:02.460 --> 18:04.330
Y-yeah?

18:07.130 --> 18:08.330
What?

18:09.710 --> 18:17.080
This time around showed me
I'm such a weakling.

18:17.380 --> 18:19.080
That's not true...

18:19.710 --> 18:23.960
Always wishy-washy and jealous of people.

18:23.960 --> 18:26.750
Thinking negative thoughts
that get me anxious.

18:26.750 --> 18:28.580
I'm a mess...

18:30.130 --> 18:31.880
But I like who I am!

18:34.630 --> 18:38.250
I think I've finally realized that.

18:39.420 --> 18:40.500
And so...

18:42.170 --> 18:43.500
That's why...

18:44.250 --> 18:52.130
Everything around me is so important,
and so special, and so lovely to me.

18:54.130 --> 18:55.670
Kyotaro Ichikawa.

18:57.040 --> 18:59.750
You made me realize who I am.

19:00.830 --> 19:02.540
Kyotaro Ichikawa.

19:04.290 --> 19:06.290
You're more important than anything.

19:07.830 --> 19:09.710
More special than anyone.

19:11.460 --> 19:13.290
You're my everything.

19:14.170 --> 19:16.130
We...

19:18.500 --> 19:20.630
Fell In Love

19:22.170 --> 19:23.670
And I love you!

19:32.080 --> 19:33.580
Will you...

19:34.130 --> 19:36.040
go out with me?

19:42.750 --> 19:43.920
Wha...

19:44.540 --> 19:45.830
I...

19:46.420 --> 19:47.630
Yes...

20:07.420 --> 20:08.290
Ow!

20:23.380 --> 20:25.000
Yippee!

20:29.580 --> 20:33.380
I really am messed up in the head.

20:43.170 --> 20:46.130
There's no way any of this is real.

20:48.290 --> 20:49.670
Yet even still...

21:00.880 --> 21:01.880
This is...

21:05.630 --> 21:06.790
How I...

21:07.380 --> 21:09.210
We...

21:07.420 --> 21:08.630
How we...

21:13.630 --> 21:15.750
Fell in Love

21:14.080 --> 21:15.500
...fell in love.

21:16.290 --> 21:21.130
I, We, Fell in Love
